        "valueString": "Neatly dressed, good grooming; mildly impatient and pushes for specific medications and investigations. Speech normal. Describes mood as “flat/over it”; affect mildly constricted but reactive. Thought process linear. No psychosis. Cognition grossly intact and orientated. Insight and judgement fair."
