          "text": "Skin findings, brief face and scalp examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Multiple erythematous, rough, scaly macules/papules measuring 3–8 mm over the vertex scalp, frontal scalp, temples, and upper forehead, described as consistent with actinic keratoses. No obvious ulceration, induration, or horn lesions. Marked background solar damage. Examination was limited to face and scalp; not a full skin check."
      }
